  "purpose": "<p>The International Development Committee is appointed by the House of Commons to scrutinise the work of the Foreign, Commonwealth &amp; Development Office in respect of aid policy, and the expenditure of Official Development Assistance&nbsp;across&nbsp;UK government departments.</p>\r\n<p>Follow us on social media: <a href=\"https://x.com/CommonsIDC\">X</a> | <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ukcommonscommittees/\">Instagram</a> | <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/house-of-commons-committees/\">LinkedIn</a></p>\r\n<p>Sign up to the weekly cross-committee newsletter, ‘<a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/email/committeecorridor\">Committee Corridor</a>’</p>",
